</mn><mo>…</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\nrounded to the nearest integer.</p>\n</div></div>",
